    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        The Coverage Principle: How Pre-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Training</span> Enables <span class="search-hit mathjax">Post</span>-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Training</span>
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Chen%2C+F">Fan Chen</a>, 
      
