    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        RL-100: Performant Robotic Manipulation with Real-World <span class="search-hit mathjax">Reinforcement</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Learning</span>
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Lei%2C+K">Kun Lei</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Li%2C+H">Huanyu Li</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Yu%2C+D">Dongjie Yu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Wei%2C+Z">Zhenyu Wei</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Guo%2C+L">Lingxiao Guo</a>, 
      
